  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Groundwater-Based Potable Water Supply for Host Communities and Refugees-Teknaf</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to supply water based on the available yield of the well field. It seeks to maximise the development of ground water resources in the region in order to create a centralised water supply for the entire host community, which will be socially, economically and environmentally sustainable in the medium to long -term.</narrative>
  </description>
